143	/// Can be used to have a location as a key in an ordered set or map.
144	///
145	/// [`Location`] itself does not implement [`Ord`] because comparing hashes like
146	/// this has no semantic meaning. The potential for misuse (e.g. checking
147	/// whether locations have a particular relative ordering) is relatively high.
148	///
