```rust
fn tag_set<'a>(
    bump: &'a Bump,
    iter: impl IntoIterator<Item = &'a Packed<TagElem>>,
) -> ListSet<BumpVec<'a, LocationKey>> {
    ListSet::new(
        iter.into_iter()
            .map(|elem| LocationKey::new(elem.tag.location()))
            .collect_in::<BumpVec<_>>(bump),
    )
}
```
It collects the locations of all tags in the given iterator into a bump-allocated `ListSet<LocationKey>`. `ListSet` is presumably a sorted vec-based set for fast lookup.

